ist the British reoccupation, but after a defeat the remnants of the division were assigned to the Japanese 38th Army in French Indochina before it was disbanded by the end of the war.","LocalizedString":"The 4th Infantry Regiment (Sendai) was attached to the 2nd Division of the Imperial Japanese Army and was one of the divisions that occupied the Dutch East Indies early in the war. The regiment later fought in the New Guinea Campaign and saw action in the Battle of Guadalcanal in the Solomon Islands. In 1944 it was ordered to Burma to resist the British reoccupation, but after a defeat the remnants of the division were assigned to the Japanese 38th Army in French Indochina before it was disbanded by the end of the war."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":true,"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Basic","isInPermanentPool":true,"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Deployment","EHelpBubbleTypes::Smokescreen"],"draftBaseWeight":1.2,"hasDeployment":true,"hasSmokescreen":true,"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion02'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/StarterContent/Audio/Explosion02.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Japan/01_Base/T_sendai_regiment.T_sendai_regiment","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Japanese WWII Postcard","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/SENDAI_REGIMENT.SENDAI_REGIMENT","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":640.0,"Y":404.0},"historyPhotoSource":"ibiblio.org a collaboration of the centerforthepublicdomain.org","historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_sendai_regiment_photo","SourceString":"The 2nd Division celebrates landing at Merak, Java, 1942.","LocalizedString":"The 2nd Division celebrates landing at Merak, Java, 1942."},"historyTypeDescription":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_sendai_regiment_header","SourceString":"Infantry","LocalizedString":"Infantry"},"blowUpExplosionNiagara":{"ObjectName":"Niagar